at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@10enjondo/works/217", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9a654532/uploads/origins/ef299225-5de9-4320-be50-886fc17d1fb6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fda464a67a6341f688205f534e9afbef", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9a654532/uploads/origins/ef299225-5de9-4320-be50-886fc17d1fb6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fda464a67a6341f688205f534e9afbef, https://si.imgix.net/9a654532/uploads/origins/ef299225-5de9-4320-be50-886fc17d1fb6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=710333d82dfb45fb8769be01d84c0ea8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9a654532/uploads/origins/ef299225-5de9-4320-be50-886fc17d1fb6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=49afb44ad752be5d1589c68a9a20e9a0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "ゼノブレイド3からミオとセナをお願いします。  \nおっぱいとすじが丸見えの構図で、羞恥に満ちた表情で立ってます。 傍らには下着(ブラジャー&ショーツ)とお尻のアップがあります。\n\n2人の胸元のクリスタルと、\nミオは首、セナは左腕にある刻印を描いてください。\n\nミオ↓\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-541sEJHznoK1GBVx62sQg6xLlj1iEMl\n\nセナ↓\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-F0hzG7Zzc3UmVsOERItTj6BBD0VyBIL", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@10enjondo/works/216", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b1be54f2/uploads/origins/2f1d9b88-af69-456b-827e-21721ff45900?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=918e1e3bc79cbfd9ff6e516ffc5d0bfd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b1be54f2/uploads/origins/2f1d9b88-af69-456b-827e-21721ff45900?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=918e1e3bc79cbfd9ff6e516ffc5d0bfd, https://si.imgix.net/b1be54f2/uploads/origins/2f1d9b88-af69-456b-827e-21721ff45900?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b00ee3e98a385e1f91203d39524bc6c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b1be54f2/uploads/origins/2f1d9b88-af69-456b-827e-21721ff45900?bg=%23